    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* To start this quest, speak to {n:Sigismund} on top of the Orastery at (E-7) of {z:Port Windurst}. He tells you about the elusive {i:Starfall Tear|Starfall Tear|546}.
* Speak with {n:Tohopka}, who is standing right next to Sigismund, at (E-7). Tohopka tells you how to collect the tears. You'll need to obtain some {i:Pugil Scales|Pugil Scales|868}. Pugils drop them, or you can find them under the AH category {p:Bonecrafting}. If there are no Scales on the AH, you can kill Pugils just outside in {z:East Sarutabaruta} for some.
* You can also find the {i:Starfall Tear|Starfall Tear|546} on the AH under the "Other" category.
* With some Scales in your possession, head out to {z:West Sarutabaruta}. On the map, there is a place called the "{p:Starfall Hillock}." In the general vicinity of that area, at (I-6), you will find the {p:Twinkle Tree}. If you're having trouble finding the tree, it's a somewhat rounded tree that has a blue firefly-type glow during the nighttime.
* Wait until the hours of 0:00 to 3:00 game time. At any other time, the tree gives the message "There is nothing out of the ordinary here," but during those three hours you'll receive another message: "A frost deposit at the base of the tree twinkles in the starlight." At this point, trade the {i:Pugil Scales|Pugil Scales|868} and you'll receive your {i:Starfall Tear|Starfall Tear|546}.
* Head back to Sigismund and give him the Tears. He gives you a {i:Fish Scale Shield|Fish Scale Shield|12316} as a reward.

